The in-progress task (`@task-hierarchical-activity-timeline`, ULID `01KJ91Q8BVDS75TV60KVRX5EKC`) was opened specifically to implement the hierarchical display — grouping commits under their task with a visual connector (pipe/bent arrow), and making orphan commits visually distinct. The task note confirms: "primarily a display-layer change to the session start human formatter. The activity_timeline data already has `linked_commit` type with task refs, so grouping logic can work from the existing data structure."

